  "title": "Hammy",
  "creator": "CrossFit",
  "description": "A long pyramid: runs of 1,200, 800, 400, 400, 800 and 1,200 m between 80 box step-overs, 40 hand-release push-ups, 40 burpees to a 6 in target, 20 strict pull-ups, 20 burpee box jumps and 10 ring muscle-ups, then back out. Honours Cpl. Stuart \"Hammy\" Hamilton, 2nd Battalion Royal Irish Regiment, killed in a training accident in 2021. Scale muscle-ups to chest-to-bar pull-ups and dips.",
